					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13006576#post-4566375</guid>
				<title>Arcadia Lives!</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13006576/arcadia-manual#post-4566375</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 26 Mar 2020 23:19:24 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>JackalRelated</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3207203</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Arcadia's back in buisness. All the logos were made by me, except the 90s pyramid logo (courtesy of <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/christopoulos" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4969651&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1585264777" alt="Christopoulos" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4969651)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/christopoulos" >Christopoulos</a></span>) and the first alternate logo (courtesy of <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3988532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1585264777" alt="Deadly Bread" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3988532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" >Deadly Bread</a></span>).</p> <p>GoI reworking undertaken by me (partially) and the rest of the Arcadia team. Thanks to everyone who made this happen.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
