					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13006576#post-4487690</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13006576/arcadia-manual#post-4487690</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2020 01:58:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>RJB_R</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1229263</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I've been talking up Arcadia with enough words, thought I'd blow it all out there so other people know what the hell I'm talking about. Big thanks to the following people for being awesome:</p> <ul> <li>JackalRelated for making the cover image.</li> <li>Celeste, change name, Daleep, Darkstuff, Elogee, Uncle Nico, Westrin, and anyone else I might be forgetting for helping me get this to the state it's in.</li> <li>Leonard Herman for giving permission to use most of the images here, with the exception of the Computer Space one which came from Wikipedia. Source for the images can be found <a href="http://www.ataricompendium.com/game_library/unreleased/unreleased.html">here</a>.</li> </ul> <p>To many more Atari Arcadia articles yet to come!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
